# Local-only files — never publish to the repository
dsh-file-edit-plugin-status.md
diff-test.py

# DEV.md is the local development handover doc: it carries absolute paths and
# machine-specific notes, so it stays out of the public repo. npm already
# excludes it via the `files` whitelist in package.json.
DEV.md

# Throwaway verification harnesses (node .verify/check-client.mjs)
.verify/

# Performance benchmark harness + its fixtures. The fixtures themselves live
# outside the repo (~/.dsh/dsh-bench-fixtures) because they are ~1.5GB of review
# state; this entry is the backstop that keeps a stray `git add .` from picking
# up the scripts or any fixture copy that lands here.
.bench/
